{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/aa7b3bc032d9da39aa9640d42f83d2da.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship crashed, only a pickaxe left? Don\u2019t panic\u2014start by mining stones and gradually craft tools and build a shelter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame an alien panther as your bodyguard and &quot;recruit&quot; alien villagers as laborers\u2014turn your survival struggle into a ruthless factory in no time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead them to explore the unknown, challenge powerful alien bosses, unlock high-tech advancements, and build a luxurious survivor base\u2014or craft a starship and make your great escape!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/547803eae4ad9ab443a3b246ec32b780.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 20x20 procedurally generated alien world\u2014discover exotic creatures and plants unseen on Earth. Head right for resource-rich mines, or left into the insectoid hive\u2026 where survival is uncertain!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events: rescue trapped miners, meet a pilot fishing for boots in the swamp, and more! Every adventure is full of surprises\u2014are you ready for the challenge?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c435f09d38b266b726bd4758307aa57d.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to jump farther? Extract rabbit DNA! Want to hit harder? Take wolf DNA! Here, every creature is your personal \u201cgene bank.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to genetic modification, you can even domesticate them or ride them across the planet, becoming the alien overlord!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c25879b6b81917bcfc653ced10ecf9c9.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit alien workers: farming, mining, no complaints! They\u2019re all your laborers, letting you enjoy the pleasure of being the boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated production line: Mine, herd, and plant during the day, craft iron and cook food at night, and serve as an alarm system before dawn! We\u2019re also preparing a multiplayer co-op system, which will be updated soon after the game launches. Gather your friends and become &quot;xeno-capitalists&quot; together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7e795a9f14098cbe1ecffd187982c99c.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a stall to attract traders, turning your place into the alien trade hub and the \u201cnew CBD\u201d!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a viral alien restaurant offering food, entertainment, and accommodation, boosting the GDP to new heights! The creative workshop will also be opened, showcasing the power of your &quot;infrastructure prowess&quot; to the entire universe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461270?t=1756288569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/a00cc03ab1560e4edaf25c65d529a10fe33f363d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756288569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/e15934ef9a61e1566b71151c1762c51af68fe430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756288569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/e15934ef9a61e1566b71151c1762c51af68fe430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756288569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join us\uff01</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to add it to your Wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to get access to the playtest:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/fb0224568d8e9453fedc56d843f48de9.avif?t=1756288569\" width=630 height=216 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/aa7b3bc032d9da39aa9640d42f83d2da.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship crashed, only a pickaxe left? Don\u2019t panic\u2014start by mining stones and gradually craft tools and build a shelter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f0538e9b9ba2d83a2a638559164a597.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame an alien panther as your bodyguard and &quot;recruit&quot; alien villagers as laborers\u2014turn your survival struggle into a ruthless factory in no time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7c538d37098f21c857714f759c45a6e3.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead them to explore the unknown, challenge powerful alien bosses, unlock high-tech advancements, and build a luxurious survivor base\u2014or craft a starship and make your great escape!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/11241c997c4788c8c1f9f18740d8f307.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/547803eae4ad9ab443a3b246ec32b780.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 20x20 procedurally generated alien world\u2014discover exotic creatures and plants unseen on Earth. Head right for resource-rich mines, or left into the insectoid hive\u2026 where survival is uncertain!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/8a6d8be34651e2a0f3193ce3b3dfcbaf.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events: rescue trapped miners, meet a pilot fishing for boots in the swamp, and more! Every adventure is full of surprises\u2014are you ready for the challenge?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d656e3a3e613522856e430d1ac594de2.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c435f09d38b266b726bd4758307aa57d.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to jump farther? Extract rabbit DNA! Want to hit harder? Take wolf DNA! Here, every creature is your personal \u201cgene bank.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/ac9233db70cea481234b750958301a30.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to genetic modification, you can even domesticate them or ride them across the planet, becoming the alien overlord!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/5f2664af17329139a9fab3624312f9ab.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/c25879b6b81917bcfc653ced10ecf9c9.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit alien workers: farming, mining, no complaints! They\u2019re all your laborers, letting you enjoy the pleasure of being the boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46704cb837c705a54647c17e28c35bcb.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated production line: Mine, herd, and plant during the day, craft iron and cook food at night, and serve as an alarm system before dawn! We\u2019re also preparing a multiplayer co-op system, which will be updated soon after the game launches. Gather your friends and become &quot;xeno-capitalists&quot; together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/04a8cb4b3642063b851dd2c0cb12df6a.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7e795a9f14098cbe1ecffd187982c99c.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a stall to attract traders, turning your place into the alien trade hub and the \u201cnew CBD\u201d!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0d35ac5676bafccb5ce39792627c3ead.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a viral alien restaurant offering food, entertainment, and accommodation, boosting the GDP to new heights! The creative workshop will also be opened, showcasing the power of your &quot;infrastructure prowess&quot; to the entire universe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.poster.avif?t=1756288569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.webm?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/d139ad9c3c5a304ded88528ec8e23ef6.mp4?t=1756288569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Miniverse Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/a158db702cf83ed7ed58021e98e7e2f5d9601b23/header.jpg?t=1756288569","is_